{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2015-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1422748800, "end_date": 1423353599, "month_true_total": 573, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:03:17 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "14377783", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069586827", "personaname": "Nalyd", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BluExMisT/", "num_games_owned": 742, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 2930, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1180, "last_played": 1453345698, "avatar": "0bfd6a007df7f197f6b622848c60547bc3e611a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really fun, especially if you play Arma life or altis. Its a little hard to run so make sure you have the PC for it.", "timestamp_created": 1423351416, "timestamp_updated": 1423351416, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14377315", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043407318", "personaname": "Twintwo3", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/slimpickenz/", "num_games_owned": 190, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 13459, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3225, "last_played": 1641263325, "avatar": "757bf539d11550861e9ab52630bf7d342e16a917"}, "language": "english", "review": "I Pre-purchased this game before it even came out and here I am nearly TWO YEARS later and this game is just terrible... Arma 2: OA is MUCH BETTER.  Arma 3 is not terrible neccesarily becuase of the gameplay, I want to add its terrible becuase it just runs absolutly HORRIBLE on my computer for some reason I have no idea why... I can never get above 25 FPS.... I have an AMD FX CPU (8 cores @ 4.0 Ghz) and an Nvidia GTX 770 GPU... WHY DOES THIS GAME RUN SO HORRIBLY BAD?? Don't tell me its cause I have an AMD processor because that is NOT a valid excuse. Even 2 years later this game is $60 and another $16 if you want two extra helicopters?  Its ridiculous! This game had potential to be a great successor to Arma 2 but it just falls SO short it isn't as fun, its runs terribly so I just cannot recomment it to anyone. Another side note, i dont know if this is because of the low quality settings i have to use...but, the sky always seems like it is soo bright and washes out detials so bad Arma 3 just look terrible. I'm so very disapointed in this game.", "timestamp_created": 1423349399, "timestamp_updated": 1423349399, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14377180", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063923571", "personaname": "MJ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198063923571/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11803, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6556, "last_played": 1507501714, "avatar": "9cce724796db9788b932d0a77633c5c12fe7e618"}, "language": "english", "review": "yes", "timestamp_created": 1423348801, "timestamp_updated": 1423348801, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14372145", "author": {"steamid": "76561198085849508", "personaname": "viggymcpiggyツ™", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcomm